 "title": "30 V N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 3.1, July 2023",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "An N-channel enhancement MOSFET built on a trench process and housed in the three-lead SOT-23. It blocks 30 V and carries 5.7 A continuously at 25 °C ambient, 30 A pulsed. On-resistance is at most 26.5 mΩ with 10 V on the gate, 32 mΩ at 4.5 V and 48 mΩ at 2.5 V, and the threshold lies between 0.65 V and 1.45 V. Offered for load switching and PWM duty; a Green product.",
